    "metaTitle": "Website Audit Report: Client-Ready SEO Report Guide",
    "metaDescription": "Learn what to include in a website audit report, how agencies structure findings, and how to turn technical SEO issues into clear client recommendations.",
    "category": "SEO Reporting",
